                    "setting": "editor",
                    "matches": {
                        "esol": [
                            "ESOL"
                        ]
                    },
                    "value": "We are here to help! We will be happy to refer you to a professional who can provide information, assistance, and guidance to students in resolving personal and social problems and difficulties. You may also refer yourself to community services as needed. The College is committed to maintaining a safe and healthy campus environment that supports the academic success of all community members. We provide confidential, professional counseling services for students experiencing difficulties related to academic performance, personal relationships, substance use, depression, and other mental health issues."
