                    "matches": {
                        "lucy_alvarez": [
                            "lalvarez@sabercollege.edu"
                        ]
                    },
                    "value": "To initiate the process, simply make a payment by calling 305-443-9170 at the main office. (Please mention the reference “payment for a transcript request”). The fee is $10.00 per copy and $25.00 for out-of-state requests. We've made it as convenient as possible for you.\n\n\nDownload and complete the request form with your information and scan the form to the following email address:\n\n\nregistrar@sabercollege.edu (All Programs)\n\n\nlinette@sabercollege.edu (All Nursing after Dec 2020)\n\n\ndestevez@sabercollege.edu (All Nursing before Dec 2020)\n\n\nlalvarez@sabercollege.edu  (All Nursing before Dec 2020)\n\n\nkarocha@sabercollege.edu (PTA Program)\n\n\n\n\nDon’t forget to attach proof of payment."
                }
            ]
        },
